  "description": "Yoon Tae-seo chased dreams of living the high life, only to end up as a mediocre, bottom-tier thug. While trying to act tough, he somehow winds up spending the night with top celebrity Baek Yi-hyun. That one night changed everything. Forced to suppress his secret desires under the public spotlight, Yi-hyun uses their encounter as an excuse to relentlessly mess with Tae-seo, and refuses to let him go.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/alley_fugitive)",
